@title Lesson step: no black band beside the sheet after a reveal near the edge
@area Learn
# Creative round 25: a running lesson showed the page shifted, with empty paper and a black band at the left.
# After a step reveal the view stays inside the sheet (a 24 px margin outside the frame, as a fit has).
# The picture is the evidence (the unit test pins the numbers); the sheet is not shown whole at a readable zoom.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text learn
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
click_text Start
wait 60
shot lesson-running
check_layout
